{"sourceUrl":"https://agri-biomanu.zzu.edu.cn/info/1013/3962.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:07.229916+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://agri-biomanu.zzu.edu.cn/info/1013/3962.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><span><span>郑州大学农业与生物制造学院成立于2018年7月，前身为郑州大学农学院，于2025年12月完成更名。学院由郑州大学和中国农业科学院棉花研究所联合共建，是郑州大学正式建制的二级教学与科研单位。学院基本定位为学科建设、科学研究、研究生培养三位一体的研究型学院，旨在围绕国家粮棉油安全战略和河南农业大省的科技需求，以主要作物、果蔬、畜禽、微生物等为研究对象，重点开展农业基础理论与关键技术的科学研究，构建高效精准的种质、品种、技术创新体系，形成</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>理论基础-育种技术-产品创制-成果转化</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>创新链，并致力于高层次人才培养。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>学院下设</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>两系五所一研究院</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>：作物学系、生物技术与工程系，合成生物与生物制造研究所、品种分子设计研究所、绿色植物保护研究所、农业资源高效创新利用研究所、农业大数据与气候智慧型农业研究所，郑州大学欧兰德种业研究院。已建立4个国家级和省部级科研平台：棉花生物育种与综合利用全国重点实验室、农业农村部地方牛羊种质资源创新利用重点实验室、河南省离子束绿色农业生物工程重点实验室、河南省农作物基因资源与改良国际联合实验室。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>十四五</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>期间，学院支撑郑州大学农业科学、植物学与动物学、微生物学3个学科进入ESI全球前1%；拥有</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>作物生物学</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>二级博士点、</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>作物学</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>一级学术型硕士点及</span></span><span><span>“</span></span><span><span>生物技术与工程</span></span><span><span>”</span></span><span><span>专业学位硕士点；获省级教学成果一等奖1项，教育部新农科教学与实践项目4项、省级教学改革项目6项、省卓越农林人才教育基地建设项目6项，并与13家单位共建研究生联合培养基地。累计招收研究生819人，毕业438人，9篇硕士论文获评省级优秀。现有专任教师83人（含外籍2人），其中正高级18人、副高级23人、博士80人，并拥有国家级高层次人才5人、省部级高层次人才19人。科研方面，发表SCI论文598篇，其中在《Nature Genetics》《Nature Plants》等高水平期刊发表36篇，强化了作物合成生物学、病虫害绿色防控、农业碳中和等特色方向；获批国家级科研项目45项，到账科研经费近1亿元，授权发明专利30项，实现成果转化4项；获农作物新品种权5项。国际合作方面，获批国家留学基金委乡村振兴人才培养专项及河南省高端外国专家项目2项，多次主办国际国内学术会议，为郑州大学一流大学建设提供了有力支撑。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>根据学校和学院工作安排，我院</span></span><span><span>2027</span></span><span><span>年推荐免试硕士研究生</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>含直博生</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>招生工作即将开始，现将有关事项安排通知如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>一</span></span><span><span>、推免资格材料审查</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考生按申请材料</span></span><span><span>1-</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>的顺序将下列材料</span></span><span><span>统一扫描整合到一个</span></span><span><span>PDF</span></span><span><span>文件</span></span><span><span>里，文件统一命名为：</span></span><span><span>报考专业</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>姓名</span></span><span><span>-</span></span><span><span>联系电话</span></span><span><span>，于</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月1</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>日1</span></span><span><span>8</span></span><span><span>:00</span></span><span><span>之前</span></span><span><span>统一发送到指定邮箱：</span></span><span><span>agri_postgraduate@zzu.edu.cn</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>、《</span></span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>年郑州大学推免预报名申请表》（要求手签且签字完整）（模板见附件</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、身份证正反面；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、本科前六个学期成绩单（加盖院系公章或学校教务处公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>、所在专业综合成绩排名证明（加盖院系公</span></span><a href=\"https://agri-biomanu.zzu.edu.cn/info/1013/3962.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"></a><span><span>章或学校教务处公章）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>5</span></span><span><span>、外语水平证明（大学英语四级、六级考试，托福，雅思，</span></span><span><span>PETS</span></span><span><span>等证书或成绩单）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>、《郑州大学申请直接攻读博士学位研究生专家推荐书》一式二份（模板见附件</span></span><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>）；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>7</span></span><span><span>、已发表的学术论文、见刊文章、获奖证书、参与的科研项目或其他能够证明个人能力的材料（没有可不提供）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>二</span></span><span><span>、招生与</span></span><span><span>面</span></span><span><span>试工作安排</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>、接收推免生</span></span><span><span>的</span></span><span><span>专业：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>作物学（招生代码</span></span><span><span>090100</span></span><span><span>）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（2）</span></span><span><span>生物技术与工程（招生代码</span></span><span><span>086001</span></span><span><span>），</span></span><span><span>其中包括</span></span><span><span>01</span></span><span><span>生物技术与工程方向和</span></span><span><span>02</span></span><span><span>卓越工程师专项方向</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、接收</span></span><span><span>直博生</span></span><span><span>的专业：</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>作物生物学（招生代码0710Z1）</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>3</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>面试</span></span><span><span>时间</span></span><span><span>：具体时间会在</span></span><span><span>QQ</span></span><span><span>群通知（群号：</span></span><span><span>1102547113</span></span><span><span>，申请进群请备注：拟报考专业</span></span><span><span>+</span></span><span><span>姓名）。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>、面试方式</span></span><span><span>：采用线上面试方式。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>三</span></span><span><span>、面试内容</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>满分</span></span><span><span>100</span></span><span><span>分，主要考查考生的专业素养、创新能力、外语水平、培养潜力、心理品质等方面的内容，通过考生递交的大学学习成绩单、毕业论文、科研成果、专家推荐信等补充材料，对考生既往学业、一贯表现、科研能力、综合素质和思想品德等情况的全面考查。面试考核时间为每名考生不少于</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span><span>分钟。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>成绩低于</span></span><span><span>60</span></span><span><span>分不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>四</span></span><span><span>、公示</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>根据面试成绩分专业从高到低排名，并在</span></span><span><span>农业与生物制造学院</span></span><span><span>官方网站进行公示。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>五、联系方式</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>杨老师</span></span><span><span>，孙老师</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>电话：</span></span><span><span>0371-67785055</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>QQ群：</span></span><span><span>1102547113</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>邮箱：</span></span><a href=\"mailto:agri_postgraduate@zzu.edu.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>agri_postgraduate@zzu.edu.cn</span></span></a></p>\n<p><span><span>联系地址：郑州大学农业与生物制造学院研究生办公室</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>六、其他</span></span><span><span>注意</span></span><span><span>事项</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>1</span></span><span><span>、</span></span><span><span>“全国推免服务系统（网址：http://yz.chsi.com.cn/tm）”</span></span><span><span>开放后，已具有推免资格的考生，</span></span><span><span>须在教育部规定的时间内登录系统注册并填报志愿，完成正式报名，并按照实际进程完成接收、确认复试及待录取通知等相应程序。</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>2</span></span><span><span>、申请人必须保证所提交申请材料的真实性和准确性。若申请人提交的信息不真实或不准确，不予录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><span> </span></p>\n<p><span><span>郑州大学</span></span><span><span>农业与生物制造学院</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span></span><span><span>9</span></span><span><span>月1</span></span><span><span>4</span></span><span><span>日</span></span></p>\n<p><br/></p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"5e0b5198f9665c515e40a4c0d9624dd4509d157f074f0029de79295f14540ced","textLength":2040,"sourceSha256":"22097c42da02e935fc61ee0fa8a2cf9bcd4ebc773d406f6688c017e1acfac703","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[{"name":"附件1 2027年郑州大学推免预报名申请表.doc","url":"https://agri-biomanu.zzu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1465810246&wbfileid=18208094"},{"name":"附件2 2027年郑州大学申请直博生专家推荐书.doc","url":"https://agri-biomanu.zzu.edu.cn/system/_content/download.jsp?urltype=news.DownloadAttachUrl&owner=1465810246&wbfileid=18208095"}],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-d783a0c5f0e64663dfa3","title":"2026年郑州大学农业与生物制造学院关于接收2027年推荐免试攻读硕士研究生（含直博生）工作安排","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:54:07.229916+00:00"}
